  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "pipeline",
      "label": "Pythonの入口",
      "source": {
        "path": "vendor/ace-step/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py",
        "start_line": 94,
        "end_line": 109,
        "url": "https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step/blob/1bee4c9f5b43e30995f8d4d33b3919197ce1bd68/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py#L94"
      },
      "excerpt": "class ACEStepPipeline:\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        checkpoint_dir=None,\n        device_id=0,\n        dtype=\"bfloat16\",\n        text_encoder_checkpoint_path=None,\n        persistent_storage_path=None,\n        torch_compile=False,\n        cpu_offload=False,\n        quantized=False,\n        overlapped_decode=False,\n        **kwargs,\n    ):\n        if not checkpoint_dir:\n            if persistent_storage_path is None:",
      "meaning": "本例は原典のPython APIを制作担当が呼ぶ。Markdownスキルやホスト生成APIではない。作者AIは依頼から呼出し実装を執筆した。"
    },
    {
      "id": "text",
      "label": "説明を条件へ",
      "source": {
        "path": "vendor/ace-step/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py",
        "start_line": 331,
        "end_line": 346,
        "url": "https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step/blob/1bee4c9f5b43e30995f8d4d33b3919197ce1bd68/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py#L331"
      },
      "excerpt": "    def get_text_embeddings(self, texts, text_max_length=256):\n        inputs = self.text_tokenizer(\n            texts,\n            return_tensors=\"pt\",\n            padding=True,\n            truncation=True,\n            max_length=text_max_length,\n        )\n        inputs = {key: value.to(self.device) for key, value in inputs.items()}\n        if self.text_encoder_model.device != self.device:\n            self.text_encoder_model.to(self.device)\n        with torch.no_grad():\n            outputs = self.text_encoder_model(**inputs)\n            last_hidden_states = outputs.last_hidden_state\n        attention_mask = inputs[\"attention_mask\"]\n        return last_hidden_states, attention_mask",
      "meaning": "説明文をトークン化し、UMT5の特徴とマスクへ。歌詞は本例では空で、歌詞ID/マスクは原典のゼロ既定。楽器や気分の実現を保証する欄ではない。"
    },
    {
      "id": "noise",
      "label": "長さとseed",
      "source": {
        "path": "vendor/ace-step/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py",
        "start_line": 928,
        "end_line": 933,
        "url": "https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step/blob/1bee4c9f5b43e30995f8d4d33b3919197ce1bd68/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py#L928"
      },
      "excerpt": "        target_latents = randn_tensor(\n            shape=(bsz, 8, 16, frame_length),\n            generator=random_generators,\n            device=self.device,\n            dtype=self.dtype,\n        )",
      "meaning": "20秒の要求から潜在時間長を取り、seedを持つ乱数で初期潜在を作る。初期ノイズ値やattentionの実測可視化ではない。"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow",
      "label": "反復して形へ",
      "source": {
        "path": "vendor/ace-step/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py",
        "start_line": 1235,
        "end_line": 1242,
        "url": "https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step/blob/1bee4c9f5b43e30995f8d4d33b3919197ce1bd68/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py#L1235"
      },
      "excerpt": "                noise_pred_with_cond = self.ace_step_transformer.decode(\n                    hidden_states=latent_model_input,\n                    attention_mask=attention_mask,\n                    encoder_hidden_states=encoder_hidden_states,\n                    encoder_hidden_mask=encoder_hidden_mask,\n                    output_length=output_length,\n                    timestep=timestep,\n                ).sample",
      "meaning": "V1の3.5B TransformerとEuler/APG。27stepは設定値。原典の反復から圧縮潜在を受け取った。Pythonの境界呼出しは測定したが、各内部step/attentionの可視化ではない。"
    },
    {
      "id": "decode",
      "label": "潜在から音へ",
      "source": {
        "path": "vendor/ace-step/acestep/music_dcae/music_dcae_pipeline.py",
        "start_line": 115,
        "end_line": 139,
        "url": "https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step/blob/1bee4c9f5b43e30995f8d4d33b3919197ce1bd68/acestep/music_dcae/music_dcae_pipeline.py#L115"
      },
      "excerpt": "    def decode(self, latents, audio_lengths=None, sr=None):\n        latents = latents / self.scale_factor + self.shift_factor\n\n        pred_wavs = []\n\n        for latent in latents:\n            mels = self.dcae.decoder(latent.unsqueeze(0))\n            mels = mels * 0.5 + 0.5\n            mels = mels * (self.max_mel_value - self.min_mel_value) + self.min_mel_value\n\n            # wav = self.vocoder.decode(mels[0]).squeeze(1)\n            # decode waveform for each channels to reduce vram footprint\n            wav_ch1 = self.vocoder.decode(mels[:,0,:,:]).squeeze(1).cpu()\n            wav_ch2 = self.vocoder.decode(mels[:,1,:,:]).squeeze(1).cpu()\n            wav = torch.cat([wav_ch1, wav_ch2],dim=0)\n\n            if sr is not None:\n                resampler = (\n                    torchaudio.transforms.Resample(44100, sr)\n                )\n                wav = resampler(wav.cpu().float())\n            else:\n                sr = 44100\n            pred_wavs.append(wav)\n",
      "meaning": "DCAEがメル表現を復元し、vocoderが左右の波形へ。原典内部で44.1kHzから指定48kHzへ変換する。制作担当による追加リサンプリングはない。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wav",
      "label": "同じWAVを使う",
      "source": {
        "path": "vendor/ace-step/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py",
        "start_line": 1413,
        "end_line": 1416,
        "url": "https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step/blob/1bee4c9f5b43e30995f8d4d33b3919197ce1bd68/acestep/pipeline_ace_step.py#L1413"
      },
      "excerpt": "        torchaudio.save(\n            output_path_wav, target_wav, sample_rate=sample_rate, format=format, backend=backend\n        )\n        return output_path_wav",
      "meaning": "原典save_wav_fileがWAVを書き出した。横に原典の入力設定JSON、別工程に数値測定。数値だけでノイズ/自然さ/ループ/独創性を確認した扱いにはしない。"
    }
  ],
